  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tPayroll\n\t\tPayroll FAQs\n\n### Can you tell me how to change payslip template?\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Tue, 26 Mar, 2019 at  1:18 PM\n\n\t\tYou may change the payslip template under the General Settings page. Please go through the below link and select Payslip Templates.\n\nSettings>> General Settings>> Payslip Templates\n\nPlease refer below screenshot for more help.\n\nClick here to watch how to change your payslip template\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
